{
 "__inputs": [
  {
   "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
   "label": "Prometheus",
   "type": "datasource",
   "pluginId": "prometheus",
   "pluginName": "Prometheus"
  }
 ],
 "title": "Omni-Compass: the governor",
 "uid": "omni-compass-governor",
 "description": "© 2026 The Omni-Compass LLC. All rights reserved. Evaluation and Simulation use only. Any commercial use, commercialization, monetization, production use, redistribution or hosted service of any part of Omni-Compass requires a signed, paid Omni-Compass Enterprise License from The Omni-Compass LLC. Every copy, export, report and printout carries this notice with LICENSE, NOTICE and DISCLOSURES.md. SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-OmniCompass-Evaluation-1.0 All patents, copyrights and trademarks filed in the USA. www.omni-compass.com",
 "tags": [
  "omni-compass",
  "governor"
 ],
 "timezone": "utc",
 "schemaVersion": 39,
 "version": 2,
 "refresh": "30s",
 "time": {
  "from": "now-6h",
  "to": "now"
 },
 "editable": true,
 "panels": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "title": "Heartbeat: beats since the last decision",
   "type": "stat",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
   },
   "description": "The governor takes its full decision at its beat, a dial from 5 to 120 s (the main engine every 60 s). This counts the beats gone by since its last decision; past three without one it is hung or gone, the alert OmniGovernorStale fires, and the watchdog hands its settings back (tools/omni_switch.py watchdog).",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 5,
    "h": 4
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "(time() - omni_last_decision_timestamp_seconds) / clamp_min(omni_heartbeat_seconds, 5)",
     "legendFormat": ""
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "none",
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "green",
        "value": null
       },
       {
        "color": "yellow",
        "value": 1.5
       },
       {
        "color": "red",
        "value": 3
       }
      ]
     },
     "decimals": 1
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {}
  },
  {
   "id": 18,
   "title": "The beat: seconds between full decisions",
   "type": "stat",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
   },
   "description": "The dial's setting the governor runs at, as measured: the median time between its last eleven full decisions (omni_heartbeat_seconds). The main engine decides every 60 s; any beat from 5 to 120 s can be set (--interval), each shown beside native on the live benchmark engine page, The heartbeat dial. The fast checks run every 5 s at every beat.",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 5,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 4,
    "h": 4
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "omni_heartbeat_seconds",
     "legendFormat": ""
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "s",
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "blue",
        "value": null
       }
      ]
     },
     "decimals": 0
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {}
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "title": "Master switch",
   "type": "stat",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
   },
   "description": "GOVERNING while it runs; OFF once the master switch (the kill switch, tools/omni_switch.py off) has handed every setting back.",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 9,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 5,
    "h": 4
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "omni_master_switch",
     "legendFormat": ""
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "mappings": [
      {
       "type": "value",
       "options": {
        "1": {
         "text": "GOVERNING",
         "color": "green"
        },
        "0": {
         "text": "OFF, handed back",
         "color": "yellow"
        }
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {}
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "title": "The verdict's state",
   "type": "stat",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
   },
   "description": "Where the brain's verdict stands: left native, trial, kept, given back. A knob that cannot prove its trial stays native.",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 14,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 5,
    "h": 4
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "omni_verdict_state",
     "legendFormat": "{{state}}"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {},
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {}
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "title": "Blind senses (it holds while blind)",
   "type": "stat",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
   },
   "description": "1 while a sense is blind: the governor then holds and writes nothing from it.",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 19,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 5,
    "h": 4
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "omni_sense_blind",
     "legendFormat": "{{sense}}"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "mappings": [
      {
       "type": "value",
       "options": {
        "0": {
         "text": "seeing",
         "color": "green"
        },
        "1": {
         "text": "BLIND, holding",
         "color": "red"
        }
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {}
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "title": "Decisions a minute",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
   },
   "description": "The pace of the governor's decisions.",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 4,
    "w": 8,
    "h": 7
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "rate(omni_decisions_total[5m]) * 60",
     "legendFormat": ""
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {},
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {}
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "title": "Decision time",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
   },
   "description": "How long each decision took: the five-minute mean and the last.",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 8,
    "y": 4,
    "w": 8,
    "h": 7
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "rate(omni_decision_seconds_sum[5m]) / rate(omni_decision_seconds_count[5m])",
     "legendFormat": "mean"
    },
    {
     "refId": "B",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "omni_decision_seconds_last",
     "legendFormat": "last"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "s"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {}
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "title": "Its own processor",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
   },
   "description": "The governor's own CPU, mean cores, from its overhead record (a few thousandths of a core in every test).",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 16,
    "y": 4,
    "w": 8,
    "h": 7
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "omni_own_cpu_cores",
     "legendFormat": ""
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "none"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {}
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "title": "Settings commands written, an hour, by reason",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
   },
   "description": "Every command the governor wrote on its own, grouped by the head of its reason (its audit says the whole reason). No person touched a setting.",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 11,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 8
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "sum by (why) (increase(omni_writes_total[1h]))",
     "legendFormat": "{{why}}"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {},
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {}
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "title": "Recommended settings",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
   },
   "description": "What the governor's last decision recommends for each setting. A recommendation is not a write: the settings written are in the panel to the left.",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 12,
    "y": 11,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 8
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "omni_recommended",
     "legendFormat": "{{setting}}"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {},
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {}
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "title": "Reversals an hour (steadiness)",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
   },
   "description": "How often each recommendation turned back the other way within the hour. The compass law is smooth by design; a setting that reverses often is looked into.",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 19,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 8
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "increase(omni_recommended_reversals_total[1h])",
     "legendFormat": "{{setting}}"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {},
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {}
  },
  {
   "id": 11,
   "title": "The compass: position in the band and force",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
   },
   "description": "Where the compass law stands inside its band (0 to 1, the 5% cushions at each end) and the force it applied at the last decision.",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 12,
    "y": 19,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 8
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "omni_compass_position",
     "legendFormat": "position"
    },
    {
     "refId": "B",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "omni_compass_force",
     "legendFormat": "force"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {},
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {}
  },
  {
   "id": 12,
   "title": "Machines in service, as the governor sees them",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
   },
   "description": "The machines the governor counted in service at each decision; a reading with none is blind and held (omni-v11).",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 27,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 7
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "omni_nodes_observed",
     "legendFormat": ""
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {},
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {}
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "title": "The audit itself",
   "type": "stat",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
   },
   "description": "Lines read from the audit, and any that were not one JSON record (expected 0).",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 12,
    "y": 27,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 7
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "omni_audit_records_total",
     "legendFormat": "records"
    },
    {
     "refId": "B",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "omni_audit_unreadable_total",
     "legendFormat": "unreadable"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {},
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {}
  },
  {
   "id": 14,
   "title": "Where the compass stood: share of decisions in the last hour",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
   },
   "description": "Each decision's compass position: slack (under the lower cushion: the service far from its line), band, or wall (at or past the line). Time in band is the control-quality figure; any share at the wall is looked into.",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 34,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 8
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "increase(omni_compass_decisions_total[1h]) / ignoring(zone) group_left sum(increase(omni_compass_decisions_total[1h]))",
     "legendFormat": "{{zone}}"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {},
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {}
  },
  {
   "id": 15,
   "title": "Time from the line back into the band",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
   },
   "description": "From the first decision at the wall to the first back inside it (the settling time), mean over the last hour and the longest so far, seconds.",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 12,
    "y": 34,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 8
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "increase(omni_wall_recovery_seconds_sum[1h]) / clamp_min(increase(omni_wall_recovery_seconds_count[1h]), 1)",
     "legendFormat": "mean, last hour"
    },
    {
     "refId": "B",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "omni_wall_recovery_seconds_max",
     "legendFormat": "longest"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {},
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {}
  },
  {
   "id": 16,
   "title": "Errors an hour, by kind",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
   },
   "description": "Errors the governor recorded, by the head of the error (a refused write, an unreadable sense). A refused write repeated at every check shows here and in the writes panel.",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 42,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 7
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "increase(omni_errors_total[1h])",
     "legendFormat": "{{kind}}"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {},
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {}
  },
  {
   "id": 17,
   "title": "Distance each recommendation travelled, an hour",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
   },
   "description": "The summed size of every change of each recommended setting within the hour (actuator travel).",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 12,
    "y": 42,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 7
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
     },
     "expr": "increase(omni_recommended_travel_total[1h])",
     "legendFormat": "{{setting}}"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {},
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {}
  }
 ],
 "links": [
  {
   "title": "How to read it: docs/OBSERVABILITY.md",
   "type": "link",
   "url": "https://github.com/The-Omni-Compass-LLC/The-Omni-Compass-LLC/blob/main/docs/OBSERVABILITY.md"
  },
